  "instance_name": "meme_concept",
  "label": "Meme Concept: 'The Only Fuck I Have Left to Give'",
  "description": "This meme format is widely used on social media to humorously or ironically express giving one's last effort, energy, or resources, often in a context of exhaustion, resignation, or dramatic finality. The phrase 'the only fuck I have left to give' is a colloquial, vulgar expression implying that the speaker has nothing more to offer — physically, emotionally, or otherwise — and is using the act of throwing something (often symbolically) to represent this final act. The phrase 'andddddd there it goes' reinforces the dramatic, almost theatrical, nature of the gesture, implying the culmination of effort or the release of all remaining resources. This concept relies on cultural understanding of military imagery, exhaustion tropes, and internet humor involving self-deprecating or exaggerated gestures.",
